 "check": {
  "describe": "Rest: Lofoten on top (night sky, aurora, red cabins), Kyoto and Santorini peeking below, 0 passed / 0 saved. Dragging right by 90 px tilts the card, fades in LIKE and lifts Kyoto. A flick (70 px in 80 ms) flies Lofoten off to the right and SAVED reads 1; a slow 65 px drag springs back with a small overshoot. Dragging Kyoto left shows NOPE over Santorini. The Pass and Save buttons fling the top card the same way. 320x568 and 700x1000 scale the card as one design. Light: a pale page with dark header text and the painted cards; dark: the night page. Mono (dark and light): the scenes become hidden-line drawings in one ink, stamps and card edges outlined, buttons outlined.",
